// data/reference/crt/close-assault.ron
//
// The Close Assault Combat Results Table (rules §15.79) — DATA.
// Human-readable companion: docs/source-materials/crt-close-assault.md
//
// Keyed by the Final Close Assault Differential (attacker CA - defender CA) -> a column
// index 0..17 (see CloseAssaultCrt::column_for_differential). Each side's two-dice roll
// is read two ways: the value (11..66) selects a loss row; the sum (2..12) selects the
// secondary result (Capt / Eng / Retreat).
//
// Sparse encoding: loss cell = (column, read_min, read_max); secondary cell =
// (column, [ (sum_min, sum_max), ... ]).  Columns:
//   0:<=-11  1:-8..-10  2:-6,-7  3:-4,-5  4:-3  5:-2  6:-1  7:0  8:+1  9:+2  10:+3
//   11:+4  12:+5,+6  13:+7,+8  14:+9,+10  15:+11..+13  16:+14..+16  17:>=+17
